WEBVTT

00:00:01.250 --> 00:00:02.330
Chara-su.

00:00:02.330 --> 00:00:05.170
Is everyone shugo-peppy again today?

00:00:05.170 --> 00:00:07.620
It's time to start Shugo Chara Party!

00:00:07.620 --> 00:00:10.790
Laugh with the anime, dance
along with us, and have fun!

00:00:10.790 --> 00:00:12.490
Everyone's hearts:

00:00:12.490 --> 00:00:13.800
Unlock!

00:00:20.600 --> 00:00:23.120
My heart: Unlock!

00:00:23.420 --> 00:00:27.350
Open up my heart!

00:00:27.350 --> 00:00:30.490
Face straight ahead, going on!

00:00:30.490 --> 00:00:33.920
We're going on forever!

00:00:33.920 --> 00:00:38.190
There's nothing to fear!

00:00:38.190 --> 00:00:45.300
Lately it feels like things have changed a bit...

00:00:45.300 --> 00:00:51.500
And it's, well, kind of nice, you know?

00:00:52.060 --> 00:00:55.690
Doesn't matter who you are, if you don't give up,

00:00:55.690 --> 00:00:59.140
you'll fly farther than you did today.

00:00:59.140 --> 00:01:02.840
Even if you cry a bunch, and get depressed,

00:01:02.840 --> 00:01:05.660
the morning will still come! So!

00:01:06.020 --> 00:01:08.910
Negative heart: Lock on!

00:01:08.910 --> 00:01:12.800
You'll find the courage!

00:01:12.800 --> 00:01:16.050
Hold your head high, going on!

00:01:16.050 --> 00:01:19.780
Continue on to tomorrow!

00:01:20.090 --> 00:01:22.970
Your heart: Unlock!

00:01:22.970 --> 00:01:26.850
Open up your heart!

00:01:26.850 --> 00:01:30.020
Face straight ahead, going on!

00:01:30.020 --> 00:01:33.580
We're going on forever!

00:01:33.580 --> 00:01:37.660
There's nothing to fear!

00:01:47.220 --> 00:01:49.780
Shugo Chara Pucchi Puchi!

00:01:49.780 --> 00:01:52.510
"I'm late! I'm late!"

00:01:53.790 --> 00:01:56.050
I'm late, I'm late!

00:01:56.050 --> 00:01:59.220
This is all because Amu-chan
didn't wake me up!

00:02:00.460 --> 00:02:02.790
Gonna crash!

00:02:05.380 --> 00:02:08.210
This is a clichéd romantic
comedy situation!

00:02:10.810 --> 00:02:14.320
Hey, brat! Where d'ya
think yer lookin'?

00:02:14.320 --> 00:02:16.450
I'm sorry!

00:02:16.450 --> 00:02:17.580
Why did it turn out like this?

00:02:17.580 --> 00:02:19.930
Why do I play this part?

00:02:20.730 --> 00:02:22.740
I'm late, I'm late!

00:02:22.740 --> 00:02:25.750
This is all because Amu-chan
didn't wake me up!

00:02:26.560 --> 00:02:28.630
Gonna crash!

00:02:31.420 --> 00:02:33.900
It's gonna be a scary
guy again, maybe?

00:02:40.080 --> 00:02:44.870
I'm sorry! Ventura, Ventura, space people!

00:02:47.620 --> 00:02:50.270
The desu part's still
the same...

00:02:50.270 --> 00:02:52.190
I'm late, I'm late!

00:02:52.190 --> 00:02:55.110
This is all because Amu-chan
didn't wake me up!

00:02:56.250 --> 00:02:58.330
Gonna crash!

00:03:01.030 --> 00:03:04.160
Is it gonna be another
UFO-like person?

00:03:05.830 --> 00:03:07.500
Kiseki?

00:03:07.500 --> 00:03:10.260
Maybe this time really is the
clichéd romantic comedy...

00:03:10.260 --> 00:03:11.460
Are you okay?

00:03:12.530 --> 00:03:17.420
I AM FINE. I AM MICHAEL
FROM CONNECTICUT.

00:03:18.800 --> 00:03:20.200
Why do you have a fake nose?

00:03:20.200 --> 00:03:23.720
That is what I want to know.

00:03:23.720 --> 00:03:25.510
I'm late, I'm late!

00:03:25.510 --> 00:03:28.700
This is all because Amu-chan
didn't wake me up!

00:03:29.330 --> 00:03:31.440
Gonna crash!

00:03:33.690 --> 00:03:35.120
What is it this time?

00:03:41.270 --> 00:03:42.860
I'm late, I'm late!

00:03:42.860 --> 00:03:45.120
This is all because
Amu-chan etc...

00:03:48.470 --> 00:03:51.640
I won't be surprised at
anything anymore!

00:03:52.460 --> 00:03:55.040
Huh? Doesn't seem
to be anyone...

00:03:58.430 --> 00:04:00.160
I'm late, late!

00:04:02.090 --> 00:04:04.330
LATE LATE!

00:04:05.160 --> 00:04:07.260
I am late, I am late!

00:04:08.020 --> 00:04:09.470
Gonna crash!

00:04:11.120 --> 00:04:12.930
See you again!

00:04:11.460 --> 00:04:12.930
What the heck?

00:04:13.930 --> 00:04:16.470
Shugo Chara Encyclopedia, Character Transformations!

00:04:16.470 --> 00:04:18.270
The first one today is...

00:04:19.610 --> 00:04:21.150
Lunatic Charm!

00:04:22.980 --> 00:04:27.620
Lunatic Charm is the form that Utau
takes when she transforms with Il!

00:04:27.870 --> 00:04:32.450
Her special attack is thrusting with
a spear-like rod, the Lilin Trident!

00:04:33.230 --> 00:04:35.600
A bright red devil character!

00:04:35.600 --> 00:04:39.840
That's Utau-chan for you... Even though it's
a devil character, she still makes it cool!

00:04:48.180 --> 00:04:50.320
And the second one is...

00:04:52.180 --> 00:04:54.310
Seraphic Charm!

00:04:55.700 --> 00:05:00.450
Seraphic Charm is the form that Utau
takes when she transforms with El!

00:05:00.450 --> 00:05:05.370
Her special techniques are singing to
purify X Eggs with Angel Cradle,

00:05:05.370 --> 00:05:09.700
and hurling white angel wings at
her enemies with White Wing!

00:05:09.700 --> 00:05:12.740
Her angel character
is cute, too!

00:05:16.330 --> 00:05:19.230
We'll keep doing these Shugo Chara
Encyclopedias each week!

00:05:19.820 --> 00:05:21.510
Look forward to it!

00:05:23.790 --> 00:05:26.410
Shugo-shugo Dance Lesson!

00:05:26.410 --> 00:05:30.130
Let's all remember the four dance parts to
"Thank you, I'm so grateful!"

00:05:30.130 --> 00:05:31.430
Today it's Lesson 2!

00:05:31.430 --> 00:05:33.800
First, look at the
example, 'kay?

00:05:34.140 --> 00:05:39.710
kimi to deatte kara mainichi
dotabata nan da

00:05:39.710 --> 00:05:45.130
warattari okottari abaretari taihen

00:05:44.980 --> 00:05:46.480
Let's try it together!

00:05:46.480 --> 00:05:48.760
Cross your hands...

00:05:48.760 --> 00:05:50.920
Fuwa... Fuwa...

00:05:51.510 --> 00:05:54.000
Repeat this three times...

00:05:54.000 --> 00:05:55.500
Then throw out your hands...

00:05:55.500 --> 00:05:56.870
Look back...

00:05:56.870 --> 00:05:58.640
Hands front, then
to your chest.

00:05:59.340 --> 00:06:00.300
Okay?

00:06:00.300 --> 00:06:02.420
Try it again this time
to the music!

00:06:02.480 --> 00:06:08.000
kimi to deatte kara mainichi
dotabata nan da

00:06:08.000 --> 00:06:13.490
warattari okottari abaretari taihen

00:06:13.340 --> 00:06:14.470
Did you do it right?

00:06:14.470 --> 00:06:17.100
Then, let's look at
the next dance.

00:06:18.170 --> 00:06:23.550
kimi to deaeta kara mainichi
wakuwaku nan da

00:06:23.550 --> 00:06:28.880
subettari korondari sore mo tanoshii

00:06:28.730 --> 00:06:30.680
Let's try it together!

00:06:30.680 --> 00:06:35.240
Wave your hands, wave your
hands, spin them around.

00:06:35.240 --> 00:06:37.780
Repeat this movement
three times.

00:06:37.780 --> 00:06:42.880
Like we did before, hands wide, look back,
hands front, then to your chest.

00:06:42.880 --> 00:06:45.540
Now, do it once again
to the music!

00:06:45.580 --> 00:06:51.000
kimi to deaeta kara mainichi
wakuwaku nan da

00:06:51.000 --> 00:06:55.980
subettari korondari sore mo tanoshii

00:06:56.380 --> 00:06:57.520
Okay!

00:06:57.520 --> 00:07:01.670
Finally, try doing today's lesson
all at once! Good luck!

00:07:02.380 --> 00:07:07.890
kimi to deatte kara mainichi
dotabata nan da

00:07:07.890 --> 00:07:13.390
warattari okottari abaretari taihen

00:07:13.390 --> 00:07:18.730
kimi to deaeta kara mainichi
wakuwaku nan da

00:07:18.730 --> 00:07:23.810
subettari korondari sore mo tanoshii

00:07:24.150 --> 00:07:27.930
Was everyone able to do it?
Good luck on the next part!

00:07:33.240 --> 00:07:35.690
Shugo Chara Pucchi Puchi!

00:07:35.690 --> 00:07:38.480
"Seconds, here!"

00:07:40.640 --> 00:07:42.260
Thank you for waiting!

00:07:42.260 --> 00:07:45.400
We now begin Shugo Chara
Tea-time Theater.

00:07:47.930 --> 00:07:50.070
Mother's rice sure is delicious.

00:07:50.070 --> 00:07:52.750
Everyone, please eat your fill.

00:07:52.750 --> 00:07:53.730
Seconds!

00:07:53.730 --> 00:07:55.030
Here!

00:07:55.030 --> 00:07:57.960
Ran, you're already
finished eating?

00:07:57.960 --> 00:08:01.810
I know it's delicious, but perhaps
you should eat a bit slower.

00:08:01.810 --> 00:08:02.710
Seconds!

00:08:02.710 --> 00:08:03.370
Me, too!

00:08:03.370 --> 00:08:04.100
As for me.

00:08:04.100 --> 00:08:05.770
Here, here, here!

00:08:07.550 --> 00:08:10.720
Sheesh... Well, it's about time
for Father to also have sec-

00:08:10.720 --> 00:08:11.520
Seconds!

00:08:11.520 --> 00:08:12.270
Here!

00:08:16.170 --> 00:08:17.430
Sec-

00:08:16.380 --> 00:08:17.430
Seconds!

00:08:17.430 --> 00:08:19.240
Ran, you're eating too much!

00:08:19.240 --> 00:08:20.880
But it's so delicious!

00:08:20.880 --> 00:08:22.240
Sheesh...

00:08:22.240 --> 00:08:23.590
Mother, seconds.

00:08:23.590 --> 00:08:27.380
Sorry, but today's
rice is all gone.

00:08:27.380 --> 00:08:29.790
Thanks for the meal!

00:08:31.160 --> 00:08:32.940
The next day-nyan!

00:08:33.200 --> 00:08:34.890
Let's eat!

00:08:35.380 --> 00:08:36.820
Where's Ran?

00:08:36.820 --> 00:08:39.080
She hasn't come home yet.

00:08:39.080 --> 00:08:40.160
I see.

00:08:40.160 --> 00:08:42.480
Today I can get seconds!

00:08:44.140 --> 00:08:45.090
Seconds!

00:08:45.090 --> 00:08:45.940
Here!

00:08:46.720 --> 00:08:48.520
Hey, you! What do you
think you're doing?

00:08:48.520 --> 00:08:49.880
Flippy-nya...

00:08:49.880 --> 00:08:52.340
Anyone else want seconds?

00:08:52.340 --> 00:08:53.430
I-

00:08:52.520 --> 00:08:53.430
Seconds!

00:08:53.430 --> 00:08:54.380
Here, here!

00:08:54.740 --> 00:08:56.550
Why you two?

00:08:56.550 --> 00:08:58.970
Damn it... This time...

00:08:58.970 --> 00:09:00.290
Sec-

00:08:59.280 --> 00:09:00.850
I'm home! Seconds!

00:09:00.850 --> 00:09:01.190
Here!

00:09:01.190 --> 00:09:02.290
What?

00:09:03.300 --> 00:09:04.610
Delicious!

00:09:04.610 --> 00:09:06.680
Ran, you will duel your father!

00:09:11.550 --> 00:09:14.150
Well then, let's eat!

00:09:15.910 --> 00:09:16.680
Seconds!

00:09:16.680 --> 00:09:17.480
Here!

00:09:19.650 --> 00:09:20.620
Seconds!

00:09:20.620 --> 00:09:20.870
Here!

00:09:21.160 --> 00:09:22.340
Seconds!

00:09:21.560 --> 00:09:23.180
Don't be led astray.

00:09:23.180 --> 00:09:25.300
Empty the mind...

00:09:26.450 --> 00:09:27.040
Now!

00:09:27.500 --> 00:09:27.910
Sec-

00:09:27.910 --> 00:09:29.540
What? At the same time?

00:09:29.760 --> 00:09:33.480
It's okay. I ate too many
snacks so I'm full.

00:09:34.160 --> 00:09:35.250
Father?

00:09:35.760 --> 00:09:37.260
Mother, seconds!

00:09:37.530 --> 00:09:39.840
Here... Here... Here...

00:09:40.920 --> 00:09:42.960
Congratulations, Father!

00:09:42.960 --> 00:09:43.770
Ran!

00:09:43.770 --> 00:09:46.770
I still have plenty of rice left!

00:09:46.770 --> 00:09:47.940
Mother!

00:09:47.940 --> 00:09:49.050
Seconds!

00:09:49.050 --> 00:09:49.540
Here!

00:09:49.540 --> 00:09:50.350
Seconds!

00:09:50.350 --> 00:09:50.820
Here!

00:09:50.820 --> 00:09:51.580
Seconds!

00:09:51.580 --> 00:09:52.400
Here!

00:09:54.980 --> 00:09:56.460
I ate too much.

00:09:56.460 --> 00:09:58.090
Here, here!

00:09:57.200 --> 00:09:58.950
See you later!

00:09:59.670 --> 00:10:03.160
Coming up next is Shugo
Chara Dokki Doki!

00:10:03.160 --> 00:10:06.750
Today's episode is "Oh, no!
Rikka and the X Eggs..."

00:10:07.020 --> 00:10:09.030
Huh? What happened?

00:10:09.030 --> 00:10:10.030
A fight?

00:10:10.030 --> 00:10:11.790
Or maybe a character
transformation?

00:10:11.790 --> 00:10:13.520
I can't wait to see!

00:10:20.760 --> 00:10:28.140
I'm sure I can be a different person than I was yesterday

00:10:28.140 --> 00:10:32.970
with a hop, step, and a jump!

00:10:37.320 --> 00:10:42.820
Since I met you I've been in a tizzy every day.

00:10:42.820 --> 00:10:48.350
Laughing, getting angry, going crazy... It's been tough!

00:10:48.350 --> 00:10:53.650
Since I was able to see you, I've been excited every day.

00:10:53.650 --> 00:10:58.500
Even slipping and falling, I've been having fun!

00:10:58.500 --> 00:11:06.480
Now that I think about it, I haven't had a chance to tell you.

00:11:06.480 --> 00:11:12.290
I have something to say.

00:11:13.680 --> 00:11:18.230
Thank you, I'm so grateful!

00:11:18.230 --> 00:11:24.580
I might not be saying it right, but it comes from my heart.

00:11:24.580 --> 00:11:29.090
Thank you, for everything!

00:11:29.090 --> 00:11:36.660
It's all thanks to you that I can be honest and say it.

00:11:47.260 --> 00:11:49.680
All right! I win.

00:11:52.330 --> 00:11:54.580
Man, I lost again!

00:11:55.170 --> 00:11:58.870
You're just too good
at this, Hotaru!

00:12:01.040 --> 00:12:03.130
I'm sleepy.

00:12:03.130 --> 00:12:05.450
I am sleepy too, Rikka-chan.

00:12:06.640 --> 00:12:08.530
But tomorrow is Sunday!

00:12:08.530 --> 00:12:10.450
But you still need to wake
up early, right?

00:12:10.450 --> 00:12:11.970
Sunday - Guardian work! Don't forget to bring paint!

00:12:11.820 --> 00:12:12.730
Right?

00:12:12.730 --> 00:12:14.080
I'm fine!

00:12:14.420 --> 00:12:16.870
I'm all prepped and
ready to go!

00:12:16.870 --> 00:12:19.120
So one more time, 'kay?

00:12:19.530 --> 00:12:21.280
Then, this will be
the final match.

00:12:21.280 --> 00:12:22.640
All righty!

00:12:23.980 --> 00:12:25.960
Huh, you want to play?

00:12:25.960 --> 00:12:26.930
Later, okay?

00:12:26.930 --> 00:12:30.290
I'm having a serious showdown
with Hotaru right now.

00:12:31.680 --> 00:12:34.010
I won't lose this time!

00:12:34.730 --> 00:12:38.490
Here we go Hotaru, hurry up!

00:12:36.620 --> 00:12:40.070
23 - Oh, no! Rikka
and the X Eggs

00:12:42.340 --> 00:12:44.870
I-I'm late!

00:12:44.870 --> 00:12:46.760
I should have gone
to sleep earlier!

00:12:46.760 --> 00:12:49.560
And in the end, I won
10 times in a row.

00:12:50.350 --> 00:12:52.520
Well I'm not gonna
lose the next time!

00:12:52.520 --> 00:12:54.330
Hurry or you'll be even more late.

00:12:54.330 --> 00:12:55.830
Of course!

00:12:55.830 --> 00:12:58.240
Hey now, your pajamas
are all in a mess.

00:12:58.240 --> 00:13:00.800
I'll clean 'em up when
I get back.

00:13:02.690 --> 00:13:05.010
Huh? You want to play?

00:13:05.880 --> 00:13:08.630
No! I'm busy.

00:13:09.570 --> 00:13:11.580
Don't get in my way!

00:13:11.580 --> 00:13:12.680
Time to go, Hotaru.

00:13:18.260 --> 00:13:20.060
A graduation commemorative party?

00:13:19.920 --> 00:13:23.270
Graduation Commemorative Party

00:13:20.400 --> 00:13:26.360
Right. It's an event that we Guardians
put on for just the students.

00:13:26.360 --> 00:13:27.910
We're preparing for it today.

00:13:29.090 --> 00:13:31.130
So it's almost time
for graduation...

00:13:31.130 --> 00:13:33.320
A whole lot sure
has happened...

00:13:33.320 --> 00:13:34.890
What are you doing?

00:13:34.890 --> 00:13:37.960
We're going to decorate the walls
of the hall with pictures.

00:13:37.960 --> 00:13:40.550
So we're choosing which
pictures to use.

00:13:40.550 --> 00:13:41.670
It's Sanjo-kun.

00:13:41.970 --> 00:13:43.380
I hope he's doing well.

00:13:43.680 --> 00:13:45.810
And Nadeshiko is here, too.

00:13:45.810 --> 00:13:49.470
I wish I could have graduated
with Nadeshiko...

00:13:49.470 --> 00:13:52.260
You might be able to graduate
with her after all, who knows?

00:13:52.260 --> 00:13:53.230
Right?

00:13:56.970 --> 00:13:59.400
Is everyone really
gonna graduate?

00:13:59.700 --> 00:14:01.470
What are you saying?

00:14:01.470 --> 00:14:05.400
I'm gonna get all lonely when the
graduation ceremony comes.

00:14:05.700 --> 00:14:08.290
But you have Rikka-chan
and Hikaru-kun, right?

00:14:08.290 --> 00:14:10.610
Make sure to do your best
as their big sister.

00:14:10.610 --> 00:14:13.290
But I'd rather be the
baby of the family!

00:14:13.290 --> 00:14:14.730
Don't worry.

00:14:15.040 --> 00:14:18.540
You can be the leader,
behind the scenes.

00:14:18.540 --> 00:14:21.170
But I will be the one who
actually is in command.

00:14:21.170 --> 00:14:24.360
That way you can still be
your baby character.

00:14:25.210 --> 00:14:27.820
Let us do our best together next year!

00:14:27.820 --> 00:14:31.020
U-Uh, that's not exactly
what I was...

00:14:31.430 --> 00:14:34.680
Hikaru-kun said, "Let's do
our best together!"

00:14:34.980 --> 00:14:39.450
Yes. His manner of speaking hasn't changed,
but the intent behind it seems to have.

00:14:39.450 --> 00:14:40.620
Yeah!

00:14:40.620 --> 00:14:44.830
You too, Rikka. You have
powers that I do not.

00:14:44.830 --> 00:14:46.590
Let us do our best together.

00:14:47.690 --> 00:14:51.160
Sheesh, what's with
those guys?

00:14:54.110 --> 00:14:55.630
Rikka-chan!

00:14:56.670 --> 00:14:57.570
What is it?

00:14:57.570 --> 00:14:59.500
That's a slow reaction...

00:14:59.500 --> 00:15:01.460
Are you feeling okay?

00:15:01.460 --> 00:15:02.840
I'm fine.

00:15:02.840 --> 00:15:05.090
Rikka-tan, where's the paints?

00:15:05.920 --> 00:15:07.760
I forgot them!

00:15:28.760 --> 00:15:30.650
You guys are the bestest!

00:16:13.130 --> 00:16:16.260
Sheesh, they ended up borrowing
Amu-senpai's...

00:16:16.260 --> 00:16:19.280
Rikka-chan, about
the X eggs...

00:16:19.580 --> 00:16:22.000
Yeah, something's wrong.

00:16:22.000 --> 00:16:24.860
I was a little flustered and
I blew up at them.

00:16:24.860 --> 00:16:26.730
Maybe they're lonely?

00:16:27.310 --> 00:16:29.290
I'll talk to them when I get home.

00:16:29.290 --> 00:16:30.310
Yeah!

00:16:32.500 --> 00:16:34.420
Anyway...

00:16:34.420 --> 00:16:35.750
What's the matter?

00:16:41.750 --> 00:16:43.890
Hey, you guys!

00:16:43.890 --> 00:16:46.240
What are you doing here?

00:16:48.480 --> 00:16:50.690
Forgot? Dropped?

00:16:50.690 --> 00:16:53.160
I don't know what you're
talking about!

00:16:53.160 --> 00:16:54.970
Go home right now!

00:16:54.970 --> 00:16:56.380
Rikka?

00:16:56.820 --> 00:16:58.450
Something the matter?

00:16:58.750 --> 00:17:00.960
Oh, it's no-no-nothing!

00:17:00.960 --> 00:17:05.250
Uh... Oh, right! I forgot something
so I'll be going home now!

00:17:05.550 --> 00:17:07.790
What did you forget other
than the paints?

00:17:08.150 --> 00:17:11.050
I-I'll be right back, so...

00:17:13.010 --> 00:17:15.150
Over there, over there?
What's over there?

00:17:15.150 --> 00:17:16.430
Be quiet!

00:17:28.210 --> 00:17:29.660
Why?

00:17:40.380 --> 00:17:42.550
Shut up!

00:17:43.220 --> 00:17:45.500
Why did you do this?

00:17:46.040 --> 00:17:48.630
I don't wanna see
you ever again!

00:17:49.440 --> 00:17:52.260
Go away, and never
come back!

00:18:30.550 --> 00:18:32.140
Rikka?

00:18:32.140 --> 00:18:33.360
Rikka!

00:18:35.070 --> 00:18:36.670
Hikaru?

00:18:36.670 --> 00:18:39.430
Hikaru-kun, go and get Amu-san
and the others!

00:18:39.430 --> 00:18:40.260
But...

00:18:40.560 --> 00:18:41.340
Hurry!

00:18:43.000 --> 00:18:43.990
Okay.

00:19:18.260 --> 00:19:21.330
Sheesh, Rikka-tan and
even Hikaru-chi!

00:19:21.330 --> 00:19:23.840
I can't imagine Hikaru
skipping out on work.

00:19:25.890 --> 00:19:27.270
Amu-chan?

00:19:27.270 --> 00:19:31.220
Rikka's been acting weird
since this morning.

00:19:31.220 --> 00:19:33.150
Did something happen?

00:19:33.150 --> 00:19:34.650
Amu!

00:19:36.010 --> 00:19:37.530
Hikaru-kun?

00:19:37.530 --> 00:19:38.490
Hikaru-chi!

00:19:38.490 --> 00:19:39.210
What's the matter?

00:19:39.210 --> 00:19:41.390
Rikka's... Rikka's...

00:19:41.390 --> 00:19:42.570
What's the matter with Rikka?

00:19:42.870 --> 00:19:45.950
Hurry... To Rikka's house!

00:19:47.010 --> 00:19:48.010
Understood.

00:19:48.010 --> 00:19:48.940
Amu-chan!

00:19:48.940 --> 00:19:49.600
Right.

00:19:49.600 --> 00:19:51.580
Let's go check out
Rikka's house!

00:19:53.090 --> 00:19:56.080
There has to be...
a reason for it...

00:19:56.080 --> 00:20:00.670
No matter what you see...
don't blame... Rikka...

00:20:04.370 --> 00:20:06.850
I'll believe in her
no matter what.

00:20:07.450 --> 00:20:10.840
In Rikka. And in you, Hikaru-kun.

00:20:15.770 --> 00:20:18.680
Leave Rikka to us, okay?

00:20:25.410 --> 00:20:28.370
What's happened to you?

00:20:37.270 --> 00:20:38.650
Why?

00:20:46.920 --> 00:20:47.930
Come here...

00:21:06.950 --> 00:21:08.440
Rikka-chan...

00:21:16.780 --> 00:21:18.710
What is this?

00:21:23.200 --> 00:21:24.680
No...

00:21:25.440 --> 00:21:26.790
No...

00:21:27.920 --> 00:21:29.530
No...!

00:21:45.920 --> 00:21:47.690
Guardian Egg Fortune Telling!

00:21:48.480 --> 00:21:52.030
Pick one of the four eggs!

00:21:53.450 --> 00:21:56.260
Which egg will be the lucky one?

00:21:59.850 --> 00:22:01.980
Guardian Egg Love Fortune!

00:22:01.980 --> 00:22:04.250
First, for those people who
chose Miki's egg...

00:22:04.250 --> 00:22:06.980
Four Shugoluck stars,
Super Lucky!

00:22:06.980 --> 00:22:09.330
Your love will progress!

00:22:09.330 --> 00:22:12.240
You might get closer to
your crush super quick!

00:22:13.480 --> 00:22:15.380
Ran's egg is three Shugoluck stars!

00:22:13.630 --> 00:22:17.560
The relationship with a boy that you're friendly with might
turn into love! Make sure to listen to their feelings!

00:22:15.380 --> 00:22:17.560
I can see friendship
turning into love!

00:22:17.560 --> 00:22:19.670
Dia's egg is two Shugoluck stars!

00:22:17.560 --> 00:22:22.180
You might screw up love if you listen to rumors.
Don't pay attention to those half-truths.

00:22:19.670 --> 00:22:22.480
Don't trust those
rumors, okay?

00:22:23.370 --> 00:22:25.740
Finally, for those of you
that chose Su's egg...

00:22:25.740 --> 00:22:28.990
No! You got um, one Shugoluck star...

00:22:28.990 --> 00:22:32.040
A person opposed to your
love might appear!

00:22:32.040 --> 00:22:34.830
Just remember to keep your
own feelings precious!

00:22:34.830 --> 00:22:37.190
Your lucky item is: a cookie!

00:22:39.200 --> 00:22:41.110
Today sure was fun!

00:22:41.110 --> 00:22:43.430
See you on the next
Shugo Chara Party!

00:22:43.430 --> 00:22:46.990
Lock On: Open Heart!

00:22:46.990 --> 00:22:48.460
Bye-bye!

00:23:16.600 --> 00:23:20.040
Now's the time to make your move.

00:23:20.040 --> 00:23:24.690
Nothing will start if you start worrying.

00:23:24.690 --> 00:23:27.110
A song to your lips!

00:23:27.110 --> 00:23:30.830
Yeah! What're you waiting for?

00:23:30.830 --> 00:23:33.610
Bang on this door to the world.

00:23:33.610 --> 00:23:37.490
On whose terms?  That's right, ours!

00:23:37.490 --> 00:23:43.020
Just trying to grasp success before you,

00:23:43.020 --> 00:23:48.590
you're sure to become
lost in the labyrinth.

00:23:50.380 --> 00:23:55.670
Embrace the melody in your heart!

00:23:55.670 --> 00:24:00.830
Try singing it, try shouting it!

00:24:00.830 --> 00:24:11.640
Each time you get closer to who you
want to be, they'll be given birth:

00:24:11.640 --> 00:24:14.260
Our Songs!
